%tokens NUMBER VARIABLE PLUS MINUS MULT DIV LPAREN RPAREN FUNCTION EXP

E -> E PLUS T *Binary | E MINUS T *Binary | T *Passthrough
T -> T MULT F *Binary | T DIV F *Binary| F *Passthrough
F -> P EXP F *Binary | P *Passthrough
P -> FUNCTION LPAREN E RPAREN *Function
P -> LPAREN E RPAREN *Parenthesized | NUMBER *Leaf | VARIABLE *Leaf 